```js
import { size as downloadSize } from './download.mjs';
import { size as storageSize } from './storage.mjs';

console.assert(downloadSize(1) === 1024);
console.assert(storageSize(1) === 1000);
```

The predicted results show that the correction reaches download but not storage. These assertions were **not run**; the conclusion is based on the supplied source and contract. No deployed impact or test coverage is established by the snapshot.

